  "score": "poor",
  "justification": "The system exhibits poor complexity management due to critical flaws in interconnection quality and system scalability. While the agent density (WebServing_Expert, Computer_terminal, Verification_Expert) seems appropriate for the task, the interconnections are inefficient and broken. The WebServing_Expert provides instructions on how to obtain an API token (step 4), but there is no mechanism for any agent to actually acquire this token and dynamically inject it into the provided code. The Verification_Expert reiterates the need to replace the placeholder token (step 6) without addressing how this replacement should occur in an automated multi-agent workflow. Consequently, the Computer_terminal repeatedly attempts to execute code with an invalid placeholder token, leading to consistent authentication errors (step 7). This reliance on manual intervention for a critical credential makes the system unscalable and unmaintainable, as it cannot self-correct or progress past a fundamental authentication barrier.",
  "evidence_steps": [
    1,
    4,
    6,
    7
  ]
}
